  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/26/hong-kongers-commemorate-the-tai-po-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">香港市民纪念大埔宝马山山火惨剧</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Hong Kongers commemorate the Tai Po fire</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">1985年大埔宝马山发生导致两名英国学生遇害的惨案，每逢清明或事件周年，都有香港市民自发前往现场悼念，呼吁人们铭记历史，反思青少年教育和心理健康的重要性。（香港本地报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/hong-kong/hong-kong-economy/article/3376084/trade-gold-and-culture-russian-envoy-pushes-closer-ties-hong-kong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">俄罗斯驻港总领事：俄方致力于深化与香港在贸易、黄金和文化领域的合作</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trade, gold and culture: Russian envoy pushes for closer ties with Hong Kong</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">俄罗斯驻香港总领事表示，俄罗斯希望通过贸易、黄金和文化交流等多元领域，进一步加强与香港的联系，旨在扩大双边合作，促进经济和文化互通。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/28/2003868526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">2026年大选：候选人发表最后呼吁争取支持</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">2026 Elections: Candidates make final call for support</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在2026年大选投票日临近之际，各主要候选人正进行最后阶段的宣传冲刺，向选民发出最后的呼吁，争取最大范围的支持，以期在选举中脱颖而出赢得席位。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cme3d4y094x7o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国崛起背后，异见声音称正被淹没</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Behind China&#x27;s spectacular rise, voices who defied it say they are being drowned out</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有观点认为，在关注中国经济快速崛起的叙事中，一些长期以来对中国发展模式提出批评或持有异见的声音，正在被官方主导的宣传所压制和边缘化，难以被外界听见。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/11/28/taiwan-elections-hongkongers-vote/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台湾大选为香港和中国大陆移民提供在家乡无法获得的自由</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan’s elections offer Hong Kong and Chinese migrants freedoms denied at home</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾的民主选举制度，为从香港和中国大陆移居至此的人们提供了一个参与政治、表达意见的平台，让他们体验到在原居地无法享有的公民自由与权利，因此备受关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">感恩节风暴袭击美国东海岸，黑色星期五销量预计创新高</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Thanksgiving storm batters East Coast. And, Black Friday sales to hit record levels</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一场强劲的感恩节风暴正在肆虐美国东海岸，给交通和民众出行带来严重影响；与此同时，市场分析师预计，即将到来的“黑色星期五”购物节销售额有望达到历史新高。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/2026/11/kushner-ukraine/689599/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">贾里德·库什纳的战略“仙尘”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Jared Kushner’s Strategic Pixie Dust</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文审视了美国前总统特朗普的女婿贾里德·库什纳在中东地区建立商业帝国，尤其是在其岳父执政期间与沙特等国建立的深厚关系，以及这些关系如何为其卸任后的商业活动铺路，揭示了其利用政治影响力获取经济利益的策略。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/27/big-tech-ai-democracy-erosion-public-trust-institutions-donald-trump/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">科技巨头已颠覆民主：以下是如何扭转这一趋势的方法</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Big Tech Has Undermined Democracy. Here’s How to Reverse the Trend.</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这篇文章探讨了大型科技公司如何通过其平台影响力、数据垄断和算法偏见对民主进程造成负面影响，并提出了包括加强监管、数据隐私保护、反垄断措施以及提升数字素养在内的具体建议，旨在恢复公民对民主制度的信任和参与。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/27/vance-rubio-trump-downside-2028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">万斯和鲁比奥付出了忠于特朗普的代价</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Vance and Rubio learn the price of loyalty to Trump</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章分析了共和党参议员J.D.万斯和马尔科·鲁比奥，在政治生涯中通过支持特朗普来巩固自身地位，但这种忠诚也带来了一系列政治和个人代价。这反映了在当前美国政治环境中，与前总统特朗普的复杂关系对共和党人职业生涯的深远影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/spain/2026-11-27/sanchez-wraps-up-his-sixth-campaign-with-the-biggest-rally-of-his-career-a-progressive-majority-is-within-sight-yes-we-can.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">桑切斯以其职业生涯最大规模的集会结束第六次竞选：“进步多数近在眼前。是的，我们能行！”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Sánchez wraps up his sixth campaign with the biggest rally of his career: “A progressive majority is within sight. Yes, we can!”</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">西班牙首相佩德罗·桑切斯在一次盛大的集会上结束了他的竞选活动，表达了对组建进步政府的信心。此次集会规模空前，显示出其政党在即将到来的选举中争取多数支持的决心，对西班牙政局走向至关重要。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/27/mad-about-mara-the-diy-dance-movement-helping-young-nigerians-escape-the-daily-grind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“马拉”热潮：DIY舞蹈运动帮助尼日利亚年轻人摆脱日常困境</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Mad about mara: the DIY dance movement helping young Nigerians escape the daily grind</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">“马拉”（mara）舞蹈在尼日利亚年轻人中兴起，成为一种流行的DIY舞蹈形式。这种舞蹈不仅是娱乐，更提供了一种表达自我、缓解生活压力、应对社会经济挑战的出口，展现了文化创造力如何成为社会适应机制。（独立视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/canada-supreme-court-largely-upholds-quebec-secularism-bill/a-80082571?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">加拿大最高法院大致维持魁北克世俗主义法案</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Canada: Supreme Court largely upholds Quebec secularism bill</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">加拿大最高法院裁定，大致维持了魁北克省的世俗主义法案（21号法案），该法案禁止部分公职人员在工作中佩戴宗教标志。这一裁决对魁北克省的宗教自由和世俗化政策具有里程碑意义，但也引发了关于少数群体权利的持续争议。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261127-s-p-revises-france-s-outlook-from-stable-to-negative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style