ne;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">哈马斯称其领导人之子在以色列袭击中幸存</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Son of Hamas chief survives Israeli strike, militant group says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据哈马斯组织透露，其一名高级领导人的儿子在以色列的空袭中幸免于难，这一消息在巴以冲突持续升级的背景下，反映了双方之间紧张的军事对抗。（冲突报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-28/francesca-albanese-detained-at-costa-rica-airport/107437818\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">联合国特别报告员弗朗西斯卡·阿尔巴内塞在哥斯达黎加机场被拒入境</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">UN rapporteur Francesca Albanese denied entry at Costa Rica Airport</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">联合国巴勒斯坦被占领土人权状况特别报告员弗朗西斯卡·阿尔巴内塞在哥斯达黎加机场被拒绝入境，此事件引发对哥斯达黎加政府行为的疑问，以及对国际人权观察员工作环境的关注。（国际新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2348412/why-young-adults-are-having-less-sex-and-why-its-getting-worse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">为什么现在的年轻人性生活越来越少，以及这种趋势为何日益加剧？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Why young adults are having less sex — and why it’s getting worse</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项最新调查显示，当代年轻人的性生活频率持续下降，这种现象背后涉及社会、经济和文化等多重因素，可能对个体幸福感和公共健康产生深远影响，值得深入探讨。（独立分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/28/opportunity-must-weigh-its-power-against-its-voters-wishes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“机遇党”必须权衡其权力与选民意愿的关系</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Opportunity must weigh its power against its voters’ wishes</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">“机遇党”当前面临挑战，需在执政权力和其选民的诉求之间找到平衡点。分析指出，忽视选民意愿可能导致支持率下降，对其未来政治走向至关重要。（中立评论）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/political/2854273/confidence-and-supply-most-sensible-course-for-opportunity-says-former-united-future-leader-peter-dunne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">前联合未来党领袖彼得·邓恩称，信任与供给协议是“机遇党”最明智的选择</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Confidence and supply most sensible course for Opportunity, says former United Future leader Peter Dunne</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰前联合未来党领袖彼得·邓恩建议，“机遇党”应采纳信任与供给协议的执政模式。他认为，这能为该党提供稳定的执政基础，避免政治僵局，是当前形势下最务实的政治策略。（政治评论）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/nz-news/361064914/finally-signing-long-running-filipino-cafe-announces-closure-after-15-years\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">经营15年之久，这家菲律宾老牌咖啡馆宣布“最终歇业”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;Finally signing off&#x27;: Long-running Filipino cafe announces closure after 15 years</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一家在社区服务了15年的菲律宾咖啡馆宣布永久关闭，结束其漫长的经营历史。这家店承载着许多顾客的回忆，其歇业反映出小企业在当前经济环境下面临的挑战。（社区新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/28/thousands-of-puerto-ricans-join-day-of-national-outrage-protest?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">数千名波多黎各人参加“全国愤怒日”抗议活动</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Thousands of Puerto Ricans join ‘Day of National Outrage’ protest</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">数千名波多黎各民众走上街头，参与“全国愤怒日”抗议活动，表达对政府政策、经济困境和社会不公的不满。此次大规模示威凸显了当地居民对现状的普遍担忧。（抗议报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm3vg3lkrk03o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">尼日利亚“终极硬汉”走红网络成为迷因</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Nigeria&#x27;s &#x27;ultimate hard man&#x27; who become an online meme</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位以强硬形象著称的尼日利亚人物，因其独特的个性和行为在社交媒体上广为传播，意外走红成为热门网络迷因。这反映了网络文化中对独特人物形象的追捧。（文化现象）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6ly7jgv7jzdo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">胡塞武装袭击沙特，挑战沙特王国的安全形象</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Inside Saudi Arabia, Houthi attacks test kingdom&#x27;s image of security</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">最近胡塞武装对沙特阿拉伯的袭击事件频发，这些攻击正在检验沙特王国长期以来构建的稳定和安全形象，并可能对其地区影响力及外资吸引力造成负面影响，引发国际社会对中东安全局势的担忧。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg28npvzeo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴西反驳马克龙关于其肉类“掺假”的说法</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Brazil pushes back on Macron calling its meat &#x27;doped&#x27;</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国总统马克龙近期将巴西肉类描述为“掺假肉”，引发了巴西政府的强烈不满和反驳。这一言论可能加剧两国在贸易和环境政策上的紧张关系，特别是对巴西重要的肉类出口产业构成挑战。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
